{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:18.35.210","page_type":"section"},"citation":"18.35.210","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.210","content_hash":"cd92bcb709698980629b0ecee31fb05fef8ce5b9961140fc1b210eb65772fcc0","heading":"Certification.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.210:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.210","text":"(a) The final plat shall contain a certificate signed and acknowledged by the parties having any title or interest in the land subdivided, consenting to the preparation and recordation of the plat as submitted. The original and six copies of the plat, as submitted, shall carry the signatures of the owners and be duly notarized by a notary public.\n(b) A certification by a registered engineer or surveyor that the details of the final plat are correct is required.\n(c) Space shall be reserved on the final plat for the date and signature of the following certificate of approval:\n(1) Chairperson and secretary of the Planning Commission;\n(2) The Council, to be signed by the Mayor and City Clerk;\n(3) The Board of County Commissioners, to be signed by two members and the chairperson;\n(4) Entry for the date and transfer of record with space for the signature of the County Clerk; and\n(5) Space for the recording of the instrument and the name of the Register of Deeds. (Code 1981 § 41-68. Code 1995 § 134-100.)\nCross References: City Council – Mayor, Chapter 2.15 TMC; City Clerk, TMC 2.20.010 ; Planning Commission, Chapter 2.225 TMC.","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"c4103197-33d9-5fd6-8a89-5d60d5b3bc63"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.35.210","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.210","content_hash":"eb261012cdac38ef16faf0a0c5e49a8c51d21b168ea34670d3565f92da1d1261","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.210:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.210:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.210","text":"(a) The final plat shall contain a certificate signed and acknowledged by the parties having any title or interest in the land subdivided, consenting to the preparation and recordation of the plat as submitted. The original and six copies of the plat, as submitted, shall carry the signatures of the owners and be duly notarized by a notary public.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"d62d032b-3fd6-5c3d-88ae-279994a59bf5"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.35.210","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.210","content_hash":"778e09c294672f56cba0a04c1a7a894857b1eaf806b120ba3bc89469c2b19e32","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.210:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.210:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.210","text":"(b) A certification by a registered engineer or surveyor that the details of the final plat are correct is required.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"90ad46dc-87fe-5523-a0d0-81c5ae7fb566"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.35.210","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.210","content_hash":"c09d7c2f1032fb27073df3d940d4ad774879325047c15ff6e0656c4d933826c7","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.210:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.210:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.210","text":"(c) Space shall be reserved on the final plat for the date and signature of the following certificate of approval:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"028fa137-be94-5900-adde-53ca5dc0d315"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.35.210","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.210","content_hash":"b600e094dd4f035fff62bfe6c3c341467d3663d568a8524510ba81de3a748d19","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.210:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.210:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.210","text":"(1) Chairperson and secretary of the Planning Commission;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"9abff213-f3b7-5631-ae0d-a1c3e5fc7deb"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.35.210","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.210","content_hash":"1071a2af09b3747c07eade3f13031daa7004daea9da105989e82e6a873db2673","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.210:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.210:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.210","text":"(2) The Council, to be signed by the Mayor and City Clerk;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"22b790e3-116b-53d0-9178-a5574da11ca3"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.35.210","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.210","content_hash":"267f3601ecacefb5d4054ad3f5efb1a8f0539847e77e42950a90e048e507e8f8","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.210:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.210:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.code