:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.210:block:8","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.210","text":"Cross References: City Council – Mayor, Chapter 2.15 TMC; City Clerk, TMC 2.20.010 ; Planning Commission, Chapter 2.225 TMC.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"a60c9ace-52d3-5bf5-8282-9c0dfba4be9f"}],"root_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.210:section","schema":"exais.jurisdiction.structured_content.v1"}